## 3. Shared primitives (pehle ye banenge, baaki sab inpe)
 
### Buttons
| Type | Look | Use |
|---|---|---|
| **Primary** | solid accent, `on-accent` text, 40px | Add to Cart, Checkout, Approve, Create account |
| **Secondary** | `surface-2` bg + `border`, primary text | Sign In, Reject, Compare |
| **Ghost** | transparent, secondary text, hover `surface-3` | Specs/Details, Reset, Remove |
| **Danger** | `danger` text + subtle danger border (solid sirf confirm dialog mein) | Cancel order |
| **Icon** | 36×36 (touch pe 44 hit-area), mandatory `aria-label` + tooltip | Close, Copilot, Cart |
 
Sab ke states: default / hover / active / `:focus-visible` (ring) / disabled (opacity .45, no pointer) / loading (spinner, width fixed).
 
### Inputs
Height 40px (auth/composer 44–48), bg `surface-2`, border `border`, radius 8, label upar (13px/500), placeholder `text-muted`, focus = accent border + ring, error = danger border + icon + message text niche.
 
### Badges (compact, 22px height, 12px text)
- **Stock:** dot + text. `● In stock` (green), `● Low stock` (amber), `● Out of stock` (muted red). Count tabhi dikhao jab real value ho.
- **Order status:** icon + text (colour akela nahi).
- **Agent chip:** neutral `surface-3` bg, 6px colored dot + name. Text colour neutral. (Abhi 8 saturated colored pills hain, wo hataane hain.)
- **Verification:** icon + text (neeche Copilot section).
### Icons
Ek SVG icon set. Agar project mein already library hai (Lucide / Material) to wahi, warna inline SVG. Naya dependency tabhi jab zaroori ho.
 
