## 4. Component-wise layout & alignment
 
### 4.1 App shell + Navbar (2 bars → 1 bar)
 
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [◆ AgentCommerce]     Storefront   Orders        [✦ Copilot] [🛒 3] [Sign in] [Sign up] │  64px, sticky
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
- Height **64px**, bg `rgba(10,11,14,.85)` + blur(8px) + bottom border. Content max **1280**, centered.
- **3 zones:** left logo | centre-left nav tabs | right actions. Sub-nav bar **hata ke** tabs navbar mein.
- Logo: SVG mark (chhota rounded-square, accent) + "AgentCommerce" 16/600. Subtitle "MULTI-AGENT AI" hata do ya `md+` pe 11px muted.
- Active tab: text primary + 2px accent underline (nav ke bottom pe), inactive secondary.
- Copilot button: **secondary** style, sparkle SVG, chhota online dot (success).
- Cart: icon button + count badge (accent bg, on-accent text, min 18px).
- Auth: "Sign in" ghost, "Sign up" **primary**. Logged in: avatar button → menu (profile naam, Orders, Logout), keyboard operable.
- **<768px:** logo + [Copilot icon][Cart icon][menu/avatar]. Tabs bottom tab-bar ya scrollable row navbar ke neeche (56px). Auth buttons menu ke andar.
- Main content: `padding-inline: var(--gutter)`, `max-width: 1280`, section gap 32–48px. Horizontal overflow zero.
