### 4.4 Product card
 
```
┌───────────────────────┐
│ [image 4:3, cover]  ◻ │ ← compare toggle top-right (icon button)
├───────────────────────┤
│ ZENITH           ★ 4.8│  ← 12px brand (muted, uppercase) | rating (agar real data)
│ ZenBook Ultra 15      │  ← 16/600, 2-line clamp, min-height 44px
│ ● In stock            │  ← 12px
│ ₹89,999               │  ← 20/650
│ [   Add to cart   ][✦][ⓘ] │ ← primary flex-1 | icon | icon
└───────────────────────┘
```
- Card: surface-1, 1px border, radius 12, padding **16**, internal gap 12. Hover: border → `border-strong`, image zoom `scale(1.03)` 220ms. **Lift/glow nahi.**
- Image: fixed `aspect-ratio: 4/3`, radius 8, bg `surface-2`. Abhi ke photos lifestyle shots hain (varying backgrounds) isliye **`object-fit: cover`** se sab tiles uniform dikhenge. Agar baad mein clean cut-out product images aayein to `contain` + light tile (`#EEF0F3`, padding 16) par switch.
- Missing image → placeholder icon on surface-2. `alt` = product name.
- **Stock overlay hata** (overlap bug); stock status text card body mein.
- Description card se hata do (Specs/detail modal mein hai) → card chhota, scan karna aasan. Agar rakhni ho to 1-line clamp.
- Buttons row hamesha card ke **bottom pe pinned** (`margin-top: auto`, card `display:flex; flex-direction:column`) → rows mein buttons jump nahi karenge.
- Primary: **Add to cart** (accent solid, 40px). Secondary actions icon-only 40×40: **Ask Copilot** (sparkle), **Details** (info). Tooltips + `aria-label`.
- Compare: image ke top-right pe check-toggle (selected = accent fill). Hit area ≥ 36px.
- Price: `Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN')`, whole rupee pe decimals nahi: `₹89,999`.
- Rating sirf **real data** ho tab. (Code mein check karna hai.)
**Grid:** `display:grid; gap:20px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(264px, 1fr))`
 
| Viewport | Columns |
|---|---|
| 1440 / 1280 | 4 |
| 1024 | 3 |
| 768 | 2 |
| 390 / 360 | 2, **compact card**: padding 12, price 16px, description hidden, Add button + Copilot icon, details = card tap |
 
