  - Header per product: image 96px, name, price, **Add to cart**, remove.
  - Rows grouped by section, alternating subtle bg; **differing values highlighted** (accent-subtle bg + bold) — yeh sirf display logic hai, data change nahi.
  - Footer action: "Ask Copilot to compare" secondary.
- Mobile: same table horizontal scroll with sticky label column, header sticky top.
---
 
## 5. Global rules (har component pe lagu)
 
1. Hex values component CSS mein **nahi**, sirf tokens.
2. Emoji → SVG. Decorative gradient/glow nahi.
3. Har interactive element: visible `:focus-visible` ring, min touch target 40px (mobile 44px).
4. Status ke liye colour + icon + text (colour-blind safe).
5. Motion 150–220ms, `prefers-reduced-motion` respect, layout shift nahi.
6. Modal/drawer: focus trap, Esc, backdrop click, focus restore, `aria-modal`, labelled title.
7. Prices `en-IN` format (display only).
8. `!important` avoid; component styles encapsulated, shared patterns `styles.css` mein.
